,"https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1440/xl_38-MC1_4908-michaela-joy-photography-event_websize.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1440/xxl_38-MC1_4908-michaela-joy-photography-event_websize.jpg",{"id":177,"assetUrl":5},"365",{"assetUrl":5},[],"ivp-ceo-event-farmhouse",[182,209,239],{"fullName":183,"teamSubcategories":184,"slug":195,"image":196,"abbreviatedTitle":205,"focusAreas":206,"emailAddress":207,"bio":208},"Cack Wilhelm",[185,191],{"name":186,"slug":187,"teamCategory":188},"Fintech & Crypto","fintech-crypto",{"name":189,"slug":190},"Investors","investors",{"name":192,"slug":193,"teamCategory":194},"Infrastructure","infrastructure",{"name":189,"slug":190},"cack-wilhelm",{"id":197,"alt":10,"caption":5,"assetUrl":198,"assetUrlXs":199,"assetUrlSm":200,"assetUrlMd":201,"assetUrlLg":202,"assetUrlXl":203,"assetUrlXxl":204},"2344","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2344/IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Cack_Wilhelm.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2344/xs_IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Cack_Wilhelm.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2344/sm_IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Cack_Wilhelm.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2344/md_IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Cack_Wilhelm.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2344/lg_IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Cack_Wilhelm.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2344/xl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Cack_Wilhelm.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2344/xxl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Cack_Wilhelm.jpg","General Partner","Cloud Infrastructure, Data Infrastructure, Information Security","cack@ivp.com","As a partner to CEOs, I draw most on my time as a professional athlete and my experience in enterprise sales at Oracle and Cloudera. I started my career as a runner for Nike, competing on a global level for two years. As any athlete knows, professional or otherwise, every ounce of energy invested in preparation increases your competitive edge. If you’re targeted in training and tenacious enough to persevere, it translates on race day. In sport and in company-building, there’s no substitute for putting in the time and effort—no shortcut to success. \r\n \r\nIn my role in venture, I think of being a partner to founders and execs in the same way that I think about being on a sports team: we all have one another’s best interests in mind, and we’re united through a shared understanding and a common goal. Both inside the walls of the firm and beyond them. \r\n\r\nI strive to go the extra mile for the companies I work with, leveraging my knowledge of enterprise sales to contribute in meaningful ways, whether by surfacing candidates for key roles, providing benchmarking and contextual data, making introductions or asking the right question at the right time.\r\n\r\nFrom technology that enables cloud and data infrastructure to stacks emerging for AI or information security, I work with companies developing underlying infrastructures for autonomous and business applications and for consumer experiences. That means I get to live in the future every day, hearing founders talk about the reality they aspire to create and the gaping holes they see and seek to fill. Working together toward their vision and seeing it come to fruition is the sweetest victory of all.",{"fullName":210,"teamSubcategories":211,"slug":226,"image":227,"abbreviatedTitle":236,"focusAreas":10,"emailAddress":237,"bio":238},"Blair Shane",[212,218,222],{"name":213,"slug":214,"teamCategory":215},"All","all",{"name":216,"slug":217},"Operators","operators",{"name":219,"slug":220,"teamCategory":221},"Department Heads","department-heads",{"name":216,"slug":217},{"name":223,"slug":224,"teamCategory":225},"Marketing","marketing",{"name":216,"slug":217},"blair-shane",{"id":228,"alt":10,"caption":5,"assetUrl":229,"assetUrlXs":230,"assetUrlSm":231,"assetUrlMd":232,"assetUrlLg":233,"assetUrlXl":234,"assetUrlXxl":235},"2760","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2760/IVP_Headshots_1090px_E_Blair.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2760/xs_IVP_Headshots_1090px_E_Blair.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2760/sm_IVP_Headshots_1090px_E_Blair.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2760/md_IVP_Headshots_1090px_E_Blair.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2760/lg_IVP_Headshots_1090px_E_Blair.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2760/xl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_E_Blair.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2760/xxl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_E_Blair.jpg","Partner, CMO","bshane@ivp.com","Wherever I go and whatever I do, I’m driven to make a positive difference. From my very first job shucking oysters at Swan Oyster Depot to my current role connecting the next generation of entrepreneurs with the right resources, I’ve always aimed to leave people better off. \r\n\r\nAs an operator at IVP, some of my workdays involve big decisions or creative ideas. Others entail helping a colleague or a portfolio company solve an annoying problem. But each and every day is an opportunity to make the world just a little bit better. \r\n\r\nMy optimism and push for results may annoy some, but I am convinced that almost anything is possible with focus, determination, hard work, the right team and a little luck. You just have to get to it.",{"fullName":240,"teamSubcategories":241,"slug":252,"image":253,"abbreviatedTitle":262,"focusAreas":263,"emailAddress":264,"bio":265},"Tamar Yehoshua",[242,244,248],{"name":213,"slug":214,"teamCategory":243},{"name":216,"slug":217},{"name":245,"slug":246,"teamCategory":247},"Apps","apps",{"name":189,"slug":190},{"name":249,"slug":250,"teamCategory":251},"Consumer","consumer",{"name":189,"slug":190},"tamar-yehoshua",{"id":254,"alt":10,"caption":5,"assetUrl":255,"assetUrlXs":256,"assetUrlSm":257,"assetUrlMd":258,"assetUrlLg":259,"assetUrlXl":260,"assetUrlXxl":261},"2755","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2755/IVP_Headshots_1090px_E_Tamar_Yehoshua.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2755/xs_IVP_Headshots_1090px_E_Tamar_Yehoshua.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2755/sm_IVP_Headshots_1090px_E_Tamar_Yehoshua.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2755/md_IVP_Headshots_1090px_E_Tamar_Yehoshua.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2755/lg_IVP_Headshots_1090px_E_Tamar_Yehoshua.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2755/xl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_E_Tamar_Yehoshua.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2755/xxl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_E_Tamar_Yehoshua.jpg","Venture Partner","Artificial Intelligence, Enterprise SaaS, Consumer Tech","tamar.yehoshua@glean.com","I am currently Chief Product and AI Officer at Atlassian. Over the past few months, I’ve met with incredible founders and executives, gaining an up-close view of how AI is transforming every industry and reshaping the way we work. It has become clear that every product we use today must be reimagined for this new era—and that is something I’m deeply motivated to help drive.\r\n\r\nPreviously, I was at Glean, where we built an AI-powered work assistant. Before that, I had the privilege of working at exceptional companies during their growth phases, including Amazon, Google, and Slack. Having been in the trenches—building products people love and scaling organizations to meet extraordinary demand—I learned enduring lessons about product leadership, execution, and scale.\r\n\r\nAt IVP, I share these learnings with entrepreneurs building the next generation of companies that will meaningfully improve people’s daily lives. I focus on supporting each company wherever I can, always acting with empathy for the incredibly difficult work founders do. As new technologies continue to emerge, the opportunity for startups has never been greater, and I’m excited to partner with entrepreneurs as they turn ambitious visions into reality.",{"id":267,"alt":10,"caption":5,"assetUrl":268,"assetUrlXs":269,"assetUrlSm":270,"assetUrlMd":271,"assetUrlLg":272,"assetUrlXl":273,"assetUrlXxl":274},"1434","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1434/Farmhouse_CEO_Meet-Up.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1434/xs_Farmhouse_CEO_Meet-Up.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1434/sm_Farmhouse_CEO_Meet-Up.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1434/md_Farmhouse_CEO_Meet-Up.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1434/lg_Farmhouse_CEO_Meet-Up.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1434/xl_Farmhouse_CEO_Meet-Up.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1434/xxl_Farmhouse_CEO_Meet-Up.jpg","IVP CEO Event - Farmhouse",1790351929582]